@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   物件設計
' chapter:      6-1
' realizes:     UC-05, FR-14, FR-15, FR-17
' source:       backend/src/middleware/lineSignature.middleware.js, backend/src/services/line.service.js, backend/src/services/askLimits.service.js, backend/src/services/qa.service.js（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依 LINE scope 重驗、共用限額、歷史截斷與 reply fallback 重繪
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title LINE多輪問答循序圖

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "學生" as Student
participant "LINE Platform" as LinePlatform
participant "LineSignatureMiddleware" as Signature
participant "LineController" as LineController
participant "LineService" as LineService
database "User／Enrollment／Course models" as ScopeModels
participant "AskLimitsService" as AskLimits
participant "ContextualQuestionService" as Contextualizer
participant "QaService" as QaService
database "Question／UsageLog models" as AuditModels
participant "LINE Reply／Push API" as DeliveryApi

Student -> LinePlatform : 在一對一聊天室傳送課程問題
LinePlatform -> Signature : signed webhook message
Signature -> Signature : 驗證 raw-body HMAC-SHA256
alt 簽章無效，或事件不是可識別的一對一 user
  Signature --> LinePlatform : 401／提示改用一對一聊天室
else 驗證通過
  Signature -> LineController : handleWebhook(events)
  LineController -> LineService : processWebhookEvents(event)
  LineService -> ScopeModels : find User by lineUserId\n重驗 activeCourseId + Enrollment + published Course
  alt 未綁定、選課中或課程權限失效
    LineService -> ScopeModels : 權限失效時清 activeCourseId／history
    LineService -> DeliveryApi : 回覆綁定／選課／權限提示
  else scope 有效
    LineService -> AskLimits : assertCanAsk(user, text)
    alt 超過字數或每日次數
      AskLimits --> LineService : limit error
      LineService -> DeliveryApi : 回覆限制原因，不呼叫 AI
    else 允許提問
      LineService -> DeliveryApi : startLoadingAnimation(lineUserId)
      LineService -> Contextualizer : contextualizeQuestion(bounded history, text)
      Contextualizer --> LineService : standaloneQuestion
      LineService -> QaService : askQuestion(source=line, history)
      ref over QaService
        共用 QA 內部協作見圖6-1-6
      end ref
      alt QA 成功或 no-match
        QaService --> LineService : answer + citations + runtime
        LineService -> ScopeModels : 依 maxConversationTurns 更新 history
        LineService -> DeliveryApi : replyMessage(answer + 時間點／jumpUrl)
        DeliveryApi -> DeliveryApi : replyToken 過期時改用 pushMessage()
      else QA 系統端失敗
        QaService --> LineService : throw runtime error
        LineService -> AuditModels : 記錄 failed ASK + Question
        LineService -> DeliveryApi : 回覆可判讀 hard-fail 訊息
      end
    end
  end
end

note over LineService,QaService
  LINE 只保留通道特有狀態與最近對話歷史；課程 allowlist、檢索、回答與引用規則共用圖6-1-6。
  真實 LINE delivery 與 channel credentials 仍屬部署環境驗收。
end note

@enduml
